<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Sahifa Topilmadi</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            background-color: #121015; /* dark bg */
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .text-404 {
            font-size: 10rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF4B5C, #FF7B2D);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .emoji-circle {
            font-size: 5rem;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .btn-gradient {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF4B5C, #FF4B8C);
            color: white;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-gradient:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .btn-outline {
            background: #1c1a22;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid #363242;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: #2a2633;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="px-5">
        <h1 class="text-404">404</h1>
        <div class="emoji-circle">😢</div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Sahifa Topilmadi</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Kechirasiz, siz qidirayotgan sahifa mavjud emas yoki ko'chirilgan bo'lishi mumkin. Quyidagi havolalar orqali kerakli ma'lumotni toping.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a href="/" class="btn-gradient px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
                Bosh sahifaga qaytish
            </a>
            <button onclick="window.history.back()" class="btn-outline px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
                Ortga qaytish
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
